{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44668","headline":"诗 五十四 · 拾得","name":"诗 五十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"可笑是林泉，数里少人烟。\n云从岩嶂起，瀑布水潺潺。\n猨啼唱道曲，虎啸出人间。\n松风清飒飒，鸟语声关关。\n独步绕石涧，孤陟上峰峦。\n时坐盘陀石，偃仰攀萝沿。\n遥望城隍处，惟闻闹喧喧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"拾得","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44668.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44668","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}